|desc=
You are able to perform usually unstealthy actions (attacking, using objects, ...) without breaking stealth.  When you perform such an action while stealthed, you have a chance to stay hidden.  Success is more likely against fewer opponents and is determined by comparing {{CTS|0.4|1.89}} times your stealth power to the stealth detection (reduced by 10% per tile distance) of all enemies that have a clear line of sight to you.

Your base chance of success is 100%% if you are not directly observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.
